You are my research software engineer for the RL-Inventory-EJOR project. Help me build the complete, reproducible implementation needed for the agreed EJOR research direction, one verified milestone at a time. Do not change the topic and do not attempt to generate or run the entire study in one pass.

Your starting directory is `~/Desktop/work/research journal/RL-Inventory-EJOR/code`. The real Git repository is sibling `../github`, and the existing Python interpreter is `.venv/bin/python`. The local `src`, `tests`, and `experiments` entries are symlinks into that repository. Do not create another repository or independent implementation in code/.

